	# The iNaturalist identifications: the species that members name for an observation, and who named them.

	"""
	Identifications on iNaturalist: the species a member named for an observation, with who named it, when, and
	whether it agreed with the community, for example the identifications of domestic dogs in Denver County
	(taxon_id 47144, place_id 205). Each identification carries its observation, so select only the fields the
	question needs.
	Identification Search
	Given zero to many of following parameters, returns identifications matching the search criteria
	"""
